{"id":120,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":4,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"金发随风扬起，眼前的女人终于在你面前展露出真容。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"金发女人","content":"……${PlayerName}，还记得我吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_110030"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"选项","content":"我不认识你","options":["我不认识你"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"她微微一笑，捧起你的脸。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"金发女人","content":"那趁现在，好好记住吧。下一次见面会是很久以后了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_110033"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"选项","options":["你究竟是……？"],"jump":[11],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"枪声响起，几只怪物应声脱落，白色的肉壁上出现一个缺口。透过它，你看到夜莺正举枪对着你们。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"你究竟有什么目的？","voice":["vo_cgplot_110036"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"金发女人笑了，你感到自己身上一松，跌落到下方的肉块中，被赫卡蒂扶住。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"与此同时，被击败的白兽突然挣扎起身，挥动起羽翼，巨大的气浪压制住了你们所有人。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"硝烟中，那个女人慢慢走向那只怪物。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"金发女人","content":"秘密会有揭开的一天，但，不是现在。","voice":["vo_cgplot_110040"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"金发女人","content":"看看你们的城市吧，看人类的恶意正孕育着怎样的怪物……\n这是最后的狂欢。","voice":["vo_cgplot_110041"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"最后，她看向你，又露出了那熟悉的笑容。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"金发女人","content":"${PlayerName}，去见证它的终局，无论发生什么，都不要移开目光。只要你能做到……","voice":["vo_cgplot_110043"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"金发女人","content":"我就带着你想要的一切答案，在终点等你。","voice":["vo_cgplot_110044"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"金发女人","content":"再见了……","voice":["vo_cgplot_110045"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"content":"白兽腾空而起，裹挟着巨大的气流冲破穹顶，消失在夜色中。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}